</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 284.51 19.69 L 187.93 19.69 C 184.87 19.69 182.4 17.21 182.4 14.15 L 182.4 -14.15 C 182.4 -17.21 184.87 -19.69 187.93 -19.69 L 284.51 -19.69 C 287.57 -19.69 290.04 -17.21 290.04 -14.15 L 290.04 14.15 C 290.04 17.21 287.57 19.69 284.51 19.69 Z M 182.4 -19.69"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 187.01 3.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.11em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.21" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="98.38"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
