</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 284.51 66.93 L 187.93 66.93 C 184.87 66.93 182.4 64.45 182.4 61.39 L 182.4 33.09 C 182.4 30.04 184.87 27.56 187.93 27.56 L 284.51 27.56 C 287.57 27.56 290.04 30.04 290.04 33.09 L 290.04 61.39 C 290.04 64.45 287.57 66.93 284.51 66.93 Z M 182.4 27.56"></path><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 187.01 43.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.11em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="98.38"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
